  "term": "PA",
  "definition": "PA stands for physical activity. In this review, it refers to bodily activity examined in relation to mental health and linked with benefits such as better sleep, cognitive functioning, quality of life, and emotional and social functioning, while participation can be shaped by social, environmental, and cultural factors.",
